                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is actually pretty good. I usually expect games that cost less then $5 to have something wrong with them. As far as gameplay, they have done all right by me. It's a fun little game that has been well designed and thought through. The game had some problems in there first release of the game, but since the previous review I left (I updated this one) where I mentioned some of the problems, they have been corrected. It really showed that they cared for this game. I did a let's play of this game, if you want a better idea of the game for yourself, then you can check it out with the link below. It was created before the problems were fixed though, so please excuse any new copies from having them. I will do a continuation of the game later on.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/qWRX264zcE4",
